        453.4150085449219,
        505.6562194824219
      ],
      "text": "GDG: Guideline Development Group; IPD: individual patient data; MDR-TB: multidrug-resistant TB; TB: tuberculosis.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        508.98681640625,
        526.7357177734375,
        519.4907836914062
      ],
      "text": "From an “arm-based network” meta-analysis of a patient subset from the 2016 IPD for which AEs resulting in permanent discontinuation of  a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.983332633972168,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        519.98681640625,
        526.5801391601562,
        530.4907836914062
      ],
      "text": "a TB medicine (27 studies) or classified as Grade 3–5 (three studies) were reported. There are slight differences between the final estimates",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.0587768554688,
        526.5732421875,
        541.4907836914062
      ],
      "text": "(80) cited in the resultant publication   and the values derived at the time of the GDG and shown in this table, because an expanded dataset",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.98681640625,
        526.614013671875,
        552.4907836914062
      ],
      "text": "was used in the publication; however, the slight differences have no impact on the conclusions drawn on the use of these medicines. There",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.98681640625,
        526.6215209960938,
        563.4907836914062
      ],
      "text": "were insufficient records on delamanid, imipenem–cilastatin and meropenem to estimate risks. Agents that are not in Groups A, B or C",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.98681640625,
        113.97970581054688,
        574.4907836914062
      ],
      "text": "are italicized.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.0626831054688,
        527.4375610351562,
        605.5056762695312
      ],
      "text": "In 2018, the GDG recommended that, where possible, regimens be composed of all three Group A",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        604.2626953125,
        527.4453735351562,
        618.7056884765625
      ],
      "text": "agents and at least one Group B agent, so that treatment starts with at least four medicines likely to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        617.4625854492188,
        527.4255981445312,
        631.9055786132812
      ],
      "text": "be effective, and that at least three agents are continued for the remaining duration of treatment if",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        630.6627197265625,
        527.3519287109375,
        645.105712890625
      ],
      "text": "bedaquiline is stopped after 6 months. New evidence on the safety profile of bedaquiline use beyond",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987192153930664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        643.8626708984375,
        527.4190673828125,
        658.3056640625
      ],
      "text": "6 months was available to the GDG 2019. This evidence supports the safety of using bedaquiline",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        657.0626831054688,
        527.401611328125,
        671.5056762695312
      ],
      "text": "beyond 6 months in patients who receive appropriate schedules of baseline and follow-up monitoring.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.959977149963379,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        670.2626953125,
        527.4519653320312,
        684.7056884765625
      ],
      "text": "If only one or two Group A agents can be used, both Group B agents are included. If the regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.4625854492188,
        527.556396484375,
        697.9055786132812
      ],
      "text": "cannot be composed with agents from Groups A and B alone, Group C agents are added to complete",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971863746643066,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        696.552734375,
        527.4212646484375,
        711.105712890625
      ],
      "text": "For patients in whom two agents from Group A are more likely to be stopped before the  it.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        709.7527465820312,
        527.3925170898438,
        724.1077270507812
      ],
      "text": "end of treatment (e.g. pre-existing comorbidities require that both bedaquiline and linezolid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.992096900939941,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        722.9526977539062,
        527.5474853515625,
        737.3076782226562
      ],
      "text": "be stopped early because of health risks), then starting with five effective agents rather",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        736.1527099609375,
        527.4292602539062,
        750.7056884765625
      ],
      "text": "than four may be advisable.  These provisions are expected to apply to most MDR/RR-TB patients,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        749.4625854492188,
        443.15350341796875,
        763.9055786132812
      ],
      "text": "including those with additional resistance to fluoroquinolones or other medicines.",
